1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,878
Kenapa motong bawang

2
00:00:00,878 --> 00:00:01,913
bikin nangis?

3
00:00:01,913 --> 00:00:03,610
A, pedas?

4
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,985
B, ada gas?

5
00:00:05,985 --> 00:00:08,134
C, cuma sugesti?

6
00:00:09,304 --> 00:00:11,143
Jawabannya...

7
00:00:11,143 --> 00:00:12,822
B, GAS!

8
00:00:12,822 --> 00:00:13,369
Bawang punya

9
00:00:13,369 --> 00:00:14,905
senjata kimia!

10
00:00:14,905 --> 00:00:17,436
Dan ada bawang yang nggak bikin nangis...

11
00:00:17,436 --> 00:00:18,301
di akhir video.

12
00:00:18,301 --> 00:00:19,015
Begini prosesnya:

13
00:00:19,015 --> 00:00:21,658
saat dipotong, sel bawang pecah.

14
00:00:21,658 --> 00:00:25,033
Enzimnya mengubah zat belerang...

15
00:00:25,033 --> 00:00:26,783
jadi gas pemicu air mata.

16
00:00:26,783 --> 00:00:29,594
Gas itu sampai ke mata,

17
00:00:29,594 --> 00:00:30,522
dan air mata keluar

18
00:00:30,522 --> 00:00:31,583
untuk membilasnya!

19
00:00:31,583 --> 00:00:32,895
Mau nggak nangis?

20
00:00:32,895 --> 00:00:34,631
Dinginkan dulu di kulkas,

21
00:00:34,631 --> 00:00:35,872
pakai pisau yang tajam,

22
00:00:35,872 --> 00:00:37,763
dan potong akarnya paling akhir.

23
00:00:38,003 --> 00:00:39,259
Dan kejutannya:

24
00:00:39,259 --> 00:00:40,782
enzim pelakunya ditemukan

25
00:00:40,782 --> 00:00:42,663
ilmuwan Jepang tahun dua ribu dua.

26
00:00:42,663 --> 00:00:43,719
Sekarang sudah ada bawang

27
00:00:43,719 --> 00:00:45,119
yang nggak bikin nangis,

28
00:00:45,119 --> 00:00:47,420
dijual di Amerika dan Inggris!

29
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,686
Bawang memang kecil,

30
00:00:48,686 --> 00:00:50,197
tapi senjatanya kimia!

31
00:00:50,197 --> 00:00:51,186
Kirim ke temanmu

32
00:00:51,186 --> 00:00:53,977
yang selalu nangis di dapur!

